## Model card

- **Name:** GLM 5.3 FlashX Legal
- **Short description:** Z.AI's legal-domain adaptation of GLM 5.3 FlashX — same hosting stack, specialized mid-training for contract analysis and compliance work; 1M-context hybrid sparse/linear attention with domain tuning atop a very strong coding/agent base. Text+image+video in, text out.
- **Provider / access:** Z.ai Open Platform / open.zhipuai.cn (China); Z.ai global API (hosted, closed; no weights published); OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026 (GLM-5.3 generation); knowledge cutoff not publicly stated.
- **IDs:** `zai/glm-5.3-flashx-legal` (Z.ai)
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens; max output 128,000 tokens (meta).
- **Modalities:** text, image, video in; text out; reasoning yes (GLM-5.3 lineage); tool calls yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.37 / 1M input, $1.25 / 1M output, $0.075 cached input (Z.ai pricing page).
- **Architecture:** proprietary hosted; hybrid sparse/linear attention, parameter count undisclosed (FlashX = lightweight class).

